&lt;p&gt;As an Automation Engineer, you will begin establishing your professional footprint within Roboyo’s consulting and automation delivery teams. In this role, you will support project workstreams, contribute to solution design, and assist in the successful delivery of intelligent automation initiatives for our clients. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with project teams, subject‑matter experts, and business users to ensure high‑quality deliverables. You are expected to communicate clearly, manage your tasks independently, and proactively identify opportunities to add value. You will also interact with clients regularly, helping maintain strong working relationships while gaining exposure to client‑facing responsibilities. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support project workstreams, contributing to the management of scope, timeline, and deliverables under senior guidance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data and information, and assist in preparing recommendations for clients &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain basic project and solution documentation, including process flows, technical specifications, and operational procedures &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other members of the automation team to deliver solutions that address client needs &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date on industry trends and best practices, and proactively grow your consulting skills  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships with clients &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must have qualifications:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2 to 3 years of experience in automation leveraging UiPath &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Git or other version control systems, with a solid understanding of source control best practices, branching, version management, and collaborative development workflows &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable in at least one area of consulting, such as strategy, transformation, digitization, or technology &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to think strategically and creatively &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English and German communication skills  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills, with the ability to build and maintain strong client relationships &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent, proactive, and self-driven — you take initiative and don’t wait to be told what to do. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;30 Days of Annual Leave:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Enjoy 30 days of paid annual leave per year&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexible Meal or Wellbeing Benefit:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Choose between a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pluxee&lt;/span&gt; meal voucher&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Urban Sports Club membership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, fully funded by &lt;span&gt;Roboyo&lt;/span&gt; after completion of your probation period.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Company pension contribution:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; We support your future by making additional employer contributions to your pension plan.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;JobRad&lt;/span&gt; Bike Leasing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Take advantage of the &lt;span&gt;JobRad&lt;/span&gt; bicycle leasing program, with Roboyo covering maintenance and insurance costs.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexible Working: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Benefit from a flexible hybrid working environment, combining remote work with 2 office days per week to foster collaboration and team connection.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Access to Leading Technology Partners:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Work closely with an ecosystem of leading technology partners including &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;UiPath, Microsoft, &lt;span&gt;Celonis&lt;/span&gt;, OpenAI, Anthropic, Appian, and n8n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, helping shape innovative automation and AI solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;7&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Continuous Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Your growth is an ongoing priority. We continuously support you in developing new skills, expanding your expertise, and progressing your career.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A truly international environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, working with talented colleagues and clients on global automation and AI projects.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;9&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work at the forefront of Agentic AI and automation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, innovating with emerging technologies and helping shape next-generation, future-ready intelligent automation solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;10&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A growth-focused environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; where you are empowered to develop, excel, take ownership, and make a meaningful contribution.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;11&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Real impact from day one&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, with the opportunity to bring forward ideas, take initiative, and influence how we work and what we build.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture shaped by strong values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, with human-centric leadership, ownership, integrity, collaboration, and continuous growth at the heart of how we work and succeed together.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice:&lt;/strong&gt; By applying, you consent to the processing of your personal data for recruitment purposes in line with our Privacy Policy: &lt;a href=&quot;https://roboyo.global/data-privacy/&quot;&gt;https://roboyo.global/data-privacy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Descope&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Descope is a modern identity provider for customers and AI agents. Our developer-friendly tools (visual workflows, SDKs, MCP server) help organizations to easily deploy authentication, authorization, MFA, SSO, and MCP / AI agent identity without writing custom code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized by Gartner as the only Visionary in the 2026 Magic Quadrant for CIAM, Descope is trusted by 1000+ organizations in production, including GoFundMe, Databricks, GoodRx, Linktree, and You.com. The company has $88M in seed funding led by Lightspeed and Notable Capital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Descope has won nine 2026 Top Workplaces awards from Energage based on a 96% overall Workplace Experience Score.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re “descoping” identity plumbing from developers’ daily lives while helping organizations turn identity into a business enabler. Come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The ideal candidate will be based in Munich or Berlin. The territory includes Germany, Austria, and Switzerland.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute short and long term strategies to generate new logo pipeline across the DACH region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive territory growth by consistently meeting and exceeding revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory plan that generates pipeline, advances opportunities, and delivers predictable bookings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with key decision makers across Product, Engineering, Security, Architecture, and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle, from prospecting and technical discovery through negotiation and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate Descope’s value and connect modern identity solutions to each customer’s technical priorities and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create new opportunities through technology partners, channel partners, and industry relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Marketing, and leadership to deliver an exceptional customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Descope’s presence across the DACH market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel throughout the region as needed to develop relationships with customers, prospects, and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seven or more years of success selling sophisticated enterprise SaaS or cybersecurity solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of building territories across DACH, acquiring new enterprise customers, and consistently exceeding revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to CTO organizations and engaging Product, Engineering, Security, and Architecture decision makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical discovery skills and the ability to communicate effectively with developers and technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience connecting complex technical solutions to meaningful business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with identity, authentication, CIAM, developer tools, application security, or cloud infrastructure is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and presentation skills with both technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident, driven, and collaborative approach, along with the humility to succeed as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling CIAM, IAM, developer infrastructure, cybersecurity, or other highly technical platforms to large enterprises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience displacing established technologies and navigating complex migrations or modernization initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established network of enterprise technology, security, and engineering leaders across DACH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success building pipeline through executive relationships, partners, events, and targeted outbound.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationships with technology partners, cloud providers, VARs, SIs, and other channel partners.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Descope is an equal opportunity employer. We hire people based on their skills and impact, nothing else. We’re committed to a fair and transparent process across every stage of employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Final offer will depend on experience, skills, location, and overall market data. We also consider leveling, scope, and internal equity to make sure offers are fair and consistent.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please review the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.descope.com/job-candidates-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Job Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Commodities &amp;amp; Energy Trading practice is growing, and we are looking for (Senior) Managers (m/w/d) to join our team in Düsseldorf or Munich.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a (Senior) Manager, you will lead or deliver complex management consulting engagements for clients across commodity and energy trading, build trusted relationships with senior decision-makers and help grow our practice. You will combine deep industry expertise with consulting and leadership skills, taking accountability for client outcomes, team performance and commercial development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with leading commodity and energy trading organisations, utilities and large energy consumers. Our work spans strategy, operating model and process design, trading transformation, commercial optimisation, risk and regulation, flexibility integration, and technology delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to advise influential organisations on strategic priorities and deliver meaningful change across trading operations, commercial performance and new technologies, while playing a visible role in building our German and European business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take responsibility for delivering complex client engagements, leading project teams, building trusted client relationships and contributing to the growth of our Commodity &amp;amp; Energy Trading practice. The breadth of your responsibilities will reflect your experience and the level at which you join. Areas of work include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client leadership and delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Build trusted relationships with executive and senior client stakeholders, translate strategic priorities into practical programmes whilst owning complex engagements or major programmes from shaping through delivery, ensuring high-quality outcomes, strong governance and effective management of scope, risk and commercials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Business Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and shape opportunities, lead proposals and pitches, develop propositions and account plans, and contribute to business development, revenue growth and capability building. Strengthen our market profile through thought leadership, external networks, sector insight and collaboration across Baringa capabilities and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Depending on your expertise, your client work may include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating model &amp;amp; business transformation: &lt;/strong&gt;Leading trading operating model and business transformation engagements, helping clients optimise governance, processes and organisational structures to deliver sustainable operational change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital &amp;amp; trading transformation: &lt;/strong&gt;Delivering data, analytics and AI-enabled transformation initiatives, helping clients improve trading decision-making, operational efficiency and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trading systems transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Leading ETRM/CTRM transformation engagements, supporting strategy, implementation and optimisation initiatives while aligning business and technology stakeholders to achieve successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility services &amp;amp; integration: &lt;/strong&gt;Leading the delivery of flexibility strategy and integration engagements, helping clients unlock value from battery storage, renewable assets and enabling technologies across evolving energy markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk and regulatory advisory: &lt;/strong&gt;Advising clients on risk and regulatory challenges, enhancing risk management frameworks, governance and controls while supporting adaptation to evolving market and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for experienced professionals who combine management consulting experience with strong knowledge of commodity and energy markets, ideally within energy and commodity trading or trading transformation. You do not need experience across every commodity or capability listed below. We are looking for deep expertise in at least one relevant area, together with the ability to solve complex client challenges:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience delivering or leading complex consulting projects, transformation programmes or strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in at least one of Power, LNG, Gas &amp;amp; Clean Fuels, Metals or Oil, together with a strong understanding of trading organisations, markets and value chains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant expertise in one or more of the following areas: trading operating models, business process improvement, ETRM/CTRM, data, analytics and AI, flexibility and optimisation, trading strategy and portfolio management, or risk and regulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building trusted relationships with senior and executive stakeholders and influencing complex decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in business development, including shaping opportunities, leading proposals or pitches, and converting client needs into valuable work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading, coaching and developing project teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving, analytical and communication skills, with the ability to balance strategic thinking and hands-on delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;Putting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111);&quot;&gt;People&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;First.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Baringa is a People First company and wellbeing is at the forefront of our culture. We recognise the importance of work-life balance and flexible working and provide our staff amazing benefits. Some of these benefits include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Generous Annual Leave Policy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We recognise everyone needs a well-deserved break. We provide our employees with 5 weeks of annual leave, fully available at the start of each year. In addition to this, we have introduced our 5-Year Recharge benefit which allows all employees an additional 2 weeks of paid leave after 5 years continuous service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
