&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fin.ai/&quot;&gt;Fin&lt;/a&gt;, now part of Salesforce, is on a mission to help businesses provide perfect customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI Agent Fin is the highest-performing AI Customer Agent on the market today, enabling businesses to deliver impeccable, always-on customer support across the customer journey, from service, to sales, to ecommerce. Powered by our own AI models, Fin resolves complex customer issues end-to-end across every channel, with minimal set-up and integration. Fin can also be combined with our natively integrated Intercom help desk, giving modern support teams one single system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together with Salesforce, the #1 AI CRM, where humans with agents drive customer success, we&#39;re building the future of customer experience. Here, ambition meets action. Tech meets trust. And innovation isn&#39;t a buzzword, it&#39;s a way of life. The world of work as we know it is changing, and we&#39;re looking for Trailblazers who are passionate about bettering business and the world through AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to level up your career at the company leading workforce transformation in the agentic era? You&#39;re in the right place. Agentforce is the future of AI, and you are the future of Salesforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s the opportunity?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In AI, proximity to customer reality is the moat. Even the best model doesn&#39;t run itself: it takes someone who gets close enough to a customer&#39;s business to make it work, and that closeness doesn&#39;t happen on its own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s where the &lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; comes in. You&#39;ll work directly with our biggest customers at the moments that matter most in their journey with Fin, whether that&#39;s proving out value in an evaluation, getting a deployment live, or expanding what&#39;s possible once it&#39;s working, and get them to real, measurable success with Fin faster than they&#39;d get there on their own. What you learn with them feeds back into the product, so every customer after them gets there faster and better too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a very novel role in the industry, still being shaped, and you&#39;ll help sharpen what great looks like at Fin: evolving the playbooks, and shaping how we win and deliver on our biggest, highest-stakes deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership, high-visibility role for a PM who wants real time with customers and hands-on time with the product, and who&#39;s comfortable making progress before every answer is known.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will I be doing?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own outcomes for a portfolio of strategic customers deploying Fin.&lt;/strong&gt; Understand their business, their support operation, and their technical environment well enough that the deployment plan you propose earns trust immediately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the full arc yourself.&lt;/strong&gt; Pitch and demo Fin, scope the solution, hands-on configure it (including custom development if required), and unblock whatever gets in the way, whether that&#39;s a product gap, a technical integration, or a cross-functional snag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the AI expert in the room.&lt;/strong&gt; Customers should leave every conversation with you knowing more about how to get outstanding results from Fin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner tightly with Sales, Success, and R&amp;amp;D&lt;/strong&gt; so each deployment feels like one team to the customer, not a relay race.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn what you learn in the field into product.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring specific, evidence-backed input, not just feature requests, to shape the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the playbook as you go:&lt;/strong&gt; the deployment patterns, templates, and best practices that make the next ten deployments faster than the first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help define what Forward Deployed PM means at Fin&lt;/strong&gt;. It&#39;s a very novel role across the industry, still being shaped, and you&#39;ll help sharpen what it looks like here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role looks like your customers thriving with Fin, and the product getting sharper because of what you learned from them. It&#39;s product management at its core, not solutions engineering, customer success, or professional services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What skills do I need?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;No minimum years required. We care about impact, drive, and potential, evidenced through the skills below, not tenure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer obsession: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep empathy paired with a bias for action. You&#39;re motivated by solving the real problem and delivering measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; storytelling: &lt;/strong&gt;You can pitch Fin to a room of executives, then get into the technical weeds with their engineers, adjusting depth and tone without losing either audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re able to talk to engineers and customers about modern tech stack, from APIs and SaaS infrastructure to LLMs and low-code tooling. You&#39;re comfortable onboarding a customer into more technical product setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evidence-based thinking: &lt;/strong&gt;You use data, not anecdotes, to make the case for a deployment plan or a roadmap bet, and you&#39;re comfortable pulling and interpreting data (conversation logs, usage, CX metrics) to find the story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional influence: &lt;/strong&gt;You navigate organizational boundaries easily, and bring people together to get the best outcome for customers and Fin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort with ambiguity: &lt;/strong&gt;You thrive in fast-changing, undefined environments, switching fluidly between big-picture strategy and in-the-weeds execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational rigor: &lt;/strong&gt;Operational rigor: You&#39;re highly organized and structured, managing multiple deployments and priorities without becoming reactive, and you know when a moment calls for speed versus polish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Even better if you have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building product for enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup or B2B SaaS experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in technical consulting, solutions engineering, or customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the United States, compensation offered will be determined by factors such as location, job level, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. Certain roles may be eligible for incentive compensation, equity, and benefits. At Fin, we want to give people what they need to do the best work of their careers. Our benefits and programs are designed to support your health and wellbeing, your family, your time away from work, and your financial future. Offerings vary by location in line with local practices and requirements. Learn more about working at Fin and the benefits we offer at&lt;a href=&quot;http://fin.ai/careers&quot;&gt; fin.ai/careers&lt;/a&gt;. Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance and the Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring, Salesforce will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fin has a hybrid working policy. We believe that working in person helps us stay connected, collaborate easier and create a great culture while still providing flexibility to work from home. We expect employees to be in the office at least three days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a radically open and accepting culture at Fin. We avoid spending time on divisive subjects to foster a safe and cohesive work environment for everyone. As an organization, our policy is to not advocate on behalf of the company or our employees on any social or political topics out of our internal or external communications. We respect personal opinion and expression on these topics on personal social platforms on personal time, and do not challenge or confront anyone for their views on non-work related topics. Our goal is to focus on doing incredible work to achieve our goals and unite the company through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.intercom.com/careers&quot;&gt;core values&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Operations Senior Manager, Consumer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EMEA Consumer Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team drives efficient customer growth across Deliveroo and Wolt. Our mission is to help consumers discover the best in their neighborhood and make ordering a trusted, valuable part of everyday life. We identify emerging customer needs and translate them into strategies that attract new customers, deepen engagement, and build lasting loyalty. Ultimately, we champion the consumer at every step—making Deliveroo and Wolt feel local, relevant, and delightful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will work cross-functionally with business development, marketing, product, engineering, and design teams to drive growth across growth partnerships and under penetrated audience segments. You will identify, launch and develop growth partnerships across our EMEA markets to acquire and retain new customers.&amp;nbsp; You’ll go deep on customer segmentation to identify the next segment of customers we need to win to angle change growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible and accountable for projects from hypothesis to implementation to results and will get to the lowest level of detail in order to execute on high-impact experiments. The results of your work will accelerate consumer acquisition, retention, and engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Director of EMEA Growth, within the broader consumer organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategize – Shape our team’s strategy and help decide &quot;what we should do next&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build – Design and launch new initiatives from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze – Analyze experiment results to inform business decisions and future experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence – Partner with other teams - Product, Engineering, Design, Marketing, Analytics - to drive cross-functional and go-to-market execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Analytical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience in product, consulting, investment banking, or technology environments with a proven ability to build insight-driven models and solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of how to build trust and drive alignment across diverse senior Commercial and Technology leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Project Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage large-scale projects from scoping to execution, maintaining momentum across multiple functions and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurial Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A bias for action and a comfort with ambiguity, with the proactivity to build and iterate where playbooks are still being defined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to drive clarity through structured, confident communication, translating data into compelling narratives for both upwards and downwards influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Build and Test Automation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports into:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Lead QA Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; London (hybrid)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;disguise is looking for a software engineer who considers themselves a generalist programmer, specialising in build and test infrastructure. You will work on the path every change to our software takes, from commit to build to automated test results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our products design, sequence and control live productions across film and TV, broadcast, and live events. The code we ship runs in front of an audience, often with no second take, so the faster and more reliably we can tell an engineer their change is safe, the better our product is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal is test results within two hours of every build, as the number of builds and tests keeps rising. You will deliver work across all of it: CI, the build, C++, Python and AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver work across the build and test pipeline: CI configuration, distributed builds, dependencies, installers and build agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run and scale the test grid across physical and virtual machines, with an eye on both speed and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speed up test runs as test volume grows, splitting and parallelising suites and removing the bottlenecks you find&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reporting across C++ unit tests and Python integration tests to guide development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-assisted development tools to increase productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix C++ and Python in the product where it gets in the way of building or testing, and extend the test framework&#39;s control libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with QA and software engineers, including reviewing their work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;EXPERIENCE WE ARE LOOKING FOR&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Essential:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing C++ in a professional environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for tooling or test automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD or DevOps tooling, such as TeamCity or an equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS or another major cloud platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automated testing of real-time, graphics or hardware-dependent software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English, written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Desirable:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distributed or cached C++ builds, such as FASTBuild, and package managers such as conan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building on Windows with MSVC and Visual Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Git Action Script development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code coverage and test-impact analysis tooling, such as OpenCppCoverage or coverage.py&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GPU workloads in the cloud, machine images and infrastructure as code (for example Packer or Terraform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PowerShell scripting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using AI coding agents or LLMs in engineering workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Media server, real-time graphics or live events experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in what disguise does as a company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, behaviours and values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and concise communication, written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodical, with strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work autonomously, and to ask for help early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative: you make the team better, not just the pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, and keen to expand what you know&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient enough to keep experimenting when the first approach fails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY JOIN DISGUISE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work on technology powering some of the most ambitious live productions and immersive experiences in the world — alongside talented engineers across multiple disciplines and time zones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about cloud systems, real-time 3D tools, and building products that operate at global scale, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Disguise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Disguise is the industry-leading platform sitting at the heart of a new era of visual experiences. One powerful integrated system of software, hardware and services to help create the next dimension of real-time spectacle.&lt;br&gt;We partner with the biggest entertainment brands and companies in the world to deliver the A-list of live music events, live TV broadcasts, immersive experiences, installations, theatre, film and TV production, corporate communications and brand product launches. Working with Disney, Snapchat, Netflix, ESPN, the Burj Khalifa, and Adele, Disguise is the number one partner delivering the next dimension of entertainment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Watch our &lt;a href=&quot;https://vimeo.com/1152697197?fl=pl&amp;amp;fe=sh&quot;&gt;showreel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t Disguise your differences.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Innovation comes from everyone. We strive to create a workplace that reflects our diverse audience. We celebrate our people for their full authentic selves, and embrace uniqueness. Inclusion and Equity matter at Disguise. We create together and we create everywhere.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Honest. We are real with ourselves and our clients and share our ideas with openness and transparency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Evolutionary. We innovate using our user’s ever-changing needs so our technology remains ahead-of-the-game.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fearless. We take the best path, not the easiest, and innovate where it’s right, not where it’s simplest.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Resilience. We don’t give up until we find the right solution, even if it means going outside our remit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Belong.&amp;nbsp; We create an environment where everyone feels like they belong and is empowered to do their best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a suite of globally relevant competitive benefits packages as we want to make sure we retain the best talent out there. Our benefits for every perm hire, globally include:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Paid Time Off - with minimum time you must take set at 20% above statutory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working between home and our offices (dependent on role and location)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support - subscription to the Calm app, mental health first-aid buddies, employee assistance programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gig allowance - £400 (or local equivalent) to spend on tickets every year to immerse yourself in our industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Belonging policies -&amp;nbsp; including (but not limited to) support for Parental, Fertility, Miscarriage, Menopause and Transitioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training, coaching &amp;amp; mentoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;At Qualtrics, we create software that the world’s best brands use to deliver exceptional frontline experiences, build high-performing teams, and design products people love. But we are more than a platform. We are the creators and stewards of the Experience Management category serving over 18,000 clients globally. Building a category takes grit, determination, and an appreciation for the unconventional—but most of all it requires close-knit, high-functioning teams with an unwavering dedication to serving our customers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When you join one of our teams, you’ll be part of a nimble group that’s empowered to set ambitious goals and move fast to achieve them. Strategic risks are encouraged, and complex problems are solved by collaborating and iterating until the best solution comes to light. You won’t have to look to find growth opportunities— they’ll find you. From retail to government to healthcare, we’re on a mission to bring humanity, connection, and empathy back to business. Join over 5,000 people across the globe who think that’s work worth doing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Solution Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We need a Senior Solution Architect to help customers plan and deliver enterprise-grade Qualtrics solutions across APAC. You will sit at the intersection of sales, services and engineering: engaging customers early to define vision and feasibility, designing technical architectures and integration approaches (APIs, data flows, CRM integrations), and ensuring solutions are deliverable and aligned to business outcomes. This role’s primary focus is supporting the sales organisation to win and grow software opportunities, with a secondary focus on attaching the right Professional Services to those deals.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep SaaS and integration knowledge — understands APIs, cloud architectures and how platforms integrate with enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution-design fluency — translates business requirements into robust, scalable technical architectures and implementation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-facing consulting ability — builds credibility with technical and business stakeholders and leads discovery and scoping conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery mindset — scopes feasible solutions, anticipates risks, and ensures smooth handovers to delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales enablement orientation — supports sales with clear, commercial technical guidance that de-risks opportunities and helps win business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator — explains complex technical concepts in business terms and produces clear documentation and solution artefacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who thrives in ambiguity — manages multiple opportunities independently and adapts to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broaden technical leadership across the APAC region, influencing how Qualtrics solutions are positioned and implemented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to large, multi-market programs and procurement-driven customers, strengthening enterprise delivery capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product and services roadmap by surfacing repeatable customer requirements and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a visible pre-sales and go-to-market profile across Sales, Solutions and Engineering stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate feasibility and accelerate deal velocity — lead discovery and project scoping sessions with customers and internal teams to confirm technical requirements, propose architectures, and produce scoped statements of work that support commercial decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design fit-for-purpose solutions that meet business objectives — craft end-to-end technical designs (including integrations, data flows and security considerations) that adapt the Qualtrics platform to enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce delivery risk and improve outcomes — identify and mitigate technical and operational risks early, define implementation approaches, and ensure smooth transition to delivery and services teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support sales and services revenue — provide technical leadership in later-stage sales conversations, create persuasive technical materials and costed solutions, and help position services that increase license adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product and engineering priorities — consolidate repeatable design patterns and customer requirements into recommendations for Product and Engineering to improve platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve team effectiveness — contribute to process, tooling and knowledge-sharing initiatives that raise the quality and efficiency of solution architecture across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For On Your Resume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years’ relevant experience in software, pre-sales&lt;strong&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt; solution architecture, systems integration or consulting — with demonstrable experience in SaaS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing custom solutions or enterprise integrations for medium-to-large enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of APIs, MCP, web services, cloud platforms and common integration patterns (experience integrating with modern cloud data platforms an advantage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record working in sales-supporting roles or pre-sales teams, including scoping, RFP/tender responses and commercial solutioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate technical designs to both technical and non-technical stakeholders and produce clear documentation (diagrams, SOWs, proposals).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with security, performance and data architecture considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in computer science, engineering, IT or relevant experience; Qualtrics product experience is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Know About This Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll join a small but growing APAC Solutions function that supports both pre-sales and Professional Services — this is a high-impact, high-visibility role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role balances technical architecture with commercial outcomes: you’ll influence customer decisions and internal strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value autonomy, practical problem solving and sharing lessons learned to scale best practices across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team is resource-constrained and moving quickly — there are strong opportunities to shape the function and take on leadership responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
