&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an ----- address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is ----- before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At go-e, we have been pursuing the development of our vision with passion and strength from the very beginning. We are moving in an area that is characterized by breakthroughs and growth and that requires a lot of personal responsibility and creative solution finding. On our journey towards the energy transition, the mixture of innovation and security, regional and international, self-realization and professionalism is the ideal fuel for our mutual growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Key Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt; (m/f/x) in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Paris&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;who will help us to expand our customer base in France, where go-e aims to be the market leader for smart charging solutions for electric cars.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With your contribution you will influence how people will charge their cars in the future. Come and join our team that is shaping the future of e-mobility!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your area of responsibility&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, build and develop customer opportunities in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development and adaptation of Go-to-Market Strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identification of and contact with potential new customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and and further develop the existing customer base&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognition of market potential and implementation of sales opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparation of offers and long-term partner contracts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional presentation of go-e and our entire product range as well as conducting negotiations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traveling to new and existing customers in the target area to build up and strengthen relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparation of forecasts, reports and observation of competitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close cooperation with sales management and internal departments in our headquarters in Feldkirchen in Carinthia (Austria)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;It would be great if you have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of sales experience or experience in supporting key customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry knowledge and technical understanding in the field of e-mobility&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and independent way of working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel throughout France and to our Austrian headquarter&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional appearance, technical consulting skills and strong negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-oriented, open and friendly personality&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native French and fluent in English, written and verbally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;It would be even better if you have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network connections with electricians and/or electrical wholesalers, car dealers, e-mobility onlineshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network connections with energy suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German and/or other foreign language skills are an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real influence in a fast-growing organization as the first Key Account Manager in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of freedom in shaping your market: you know the region and the people, so we trust you to build it for go-e&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attractive base salary plus performance-based commission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company car (leased) for your travels across France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid co-working space in Paris, or fully remote setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a financially stable, profitable company in a strong growth phase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee discounts on our products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental well-being support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please provide your application in English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About &lt;span style=&quot;color: 0068b4;&quot;&gt; go-e GmbH&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a fast-growing, successful company in the field of e-mobility, go-e GmbH is making the transition from start-up to an internationally recognized player. From our headquarters in Carinthia, we have already expanded to around 20 countries in Europe. With bold ideas around our passion for innovative e-mobility solutions, we are already establishing future technologies. As a green tech company, environmentally conscious processes are particularly important to us, which is why we place them at the heart of everything we do. The go-e employees contribute with their personality to the good working atmosphere, and their individuality is a foundation for our common success.&lt;/h5&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now is an amazing time to join Nozomi Networks as we build the future of OT and IoT cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We defend some of the world’s largest organizations and critical infrastructure in more than 68 countries and we’re just getting started. Our AI-powered cybersecurity platform secures operational technology (OT) and Internet of Things (IoT) infrastructures for enterprises and government entities across energy, manufacturing, transportation, resources, and critical infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Deck&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;8cc75155-9d1b-5a38-8f36-c312e9d617c9|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,335551500,&amp;quot;3616031&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;20&amp;quot;,335559739,&amp;quot;140&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;JD Deck&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;JDDeck&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134245418,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;As we expand our product portfolio and global presence, our IT department is hiring a Senior Information Security Engineer to design, implement, integrate, and continuously improve security controls across enterprise infrastructure, cloud platforms, applications, and AI-enabled systems. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Deck&quot;&gt;The primary emphasis is technical security engineering and project delivery, rather than routine reporting or administrative coordination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Deck&quot;&gt;Working closely with IT Operations, Platform Engineering, Software Engineering, and security partners, this position translates security and compliance requirements into reliable technical solutions. The engineer serves as a technical escalation point for complex incidents and material risks and helps support ISO 27001, SOC 2, FedRAMP, and other applicable requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt; If this sounds like you, read on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Section&quot;&gt;In this role you will&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;2b71d4cb-ecf7-5145-9a14-571e7520c3ed|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,335551500,&amp;quot;3616031&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;18&amp;quot;,335559739,&amp;quot;60&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;JD Bullet&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;JDBullet&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,335559685,&amp;quot;259&amp;quot;,335559991,&amp;quot;202&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;264&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt; Own technical design, evaluation, implementation, integration, hardening, and lifecycle support of enterprise security platforms and controls, engineering preventive, detective, and responsive controls across identity, endpoints, networks, cloud, and business applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Integrate security technologies with enterprise systems through APIs, event pipelines, and automation to improve visibility and reduce manual operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Conduct technical security reviews and architecture assessments for new platforms, system integrations, and major infrastructure changes; troubleshoot complex security issues and lead remediation of control gaps, recurring failures, and platform reliability problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Design and enhance security for cloud workloads, infrastructure services, network boundaries, endpoints, and hybrid environments, partnering with Platform Engineering and IT Operations on cloud posture, infrastructure hardening, logging, configuration standards, and remediation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Implement secure identity patterns, including least-privilege permissions, privileged access controls, secrets management, and strong authentication, and embed security checks and baseline controls into provisioning, infrastructure automation, and change processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Partner with development teams to define security architecture, threat models, and secure integration requirements for applications, APIs, and services, and review authentication, authorization, data flows, external interfaces, and third-party components for exploitable weaknesses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Implement and improve application security testing, dependency and secrets detection, and vulnerability feedback within software delivery workflows; advance secure development practices, including risk-based release reviews and lifecycle-appropriate controls; and guide engineering teams through remediation and validation of significant findings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Assess and secure generative AI applications, AI assistants, autonomous agents, agent-to-agent workflows, and integrations with enterprise tools and data, addressing AI-specific attack paths such as prompt injection, tool misuse, sensitive data leakage, unsafe autonomy, and excessive access.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Design safeguards for agent identities, tool permissions, credential use, delegated access, execution boundaries, and least-privilege authorization, and implement practical guardrails, monitoring, activity logging, approval gates, and recovery or shutdown controls for higher-risk agent actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Perform threat modeling and security testing for AI-enabled solutions with engineering teams, documenting technical standards and mitigations and applying guidance such as NIST AI RMF, OWASP AI/LLM security guidance, and MITRE ATLAS as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;appropriate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Serve as the technical escalation point for complex security incidents, SOC findings, and investigations requiring deeper engineering &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;, leading technical containment, recovery recommendations, root-cause analysis, and engineering corrective actions for significant incidents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Improve alert quality, detection logic, telemetry coverage, investigation workflows, and response integrations with security service providers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Provide technical direction for vulnerability management across infrastructure, cloud, and applications: review findings, prioritize material exposure, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;validate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; high-risk remediation, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;eliminate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; repeated exposures through durable configuration changes, automation, and engineering improvements with system owners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Implement and maintain technical controls supporting ISO 27001, SOC 2, FedRAMP, and relevant NIST SP 800-53 requirements, including FedRAMP readiness and continuous monitoring through secure configurations, technical evidence, control validation, and remediation engineering; work with the junior analyst and compliance partners to make recurring evidence collection and control reporting accurate and repeatable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Advise on security architecture and remediation for findings from audits, penetration tests, vulnerability assessments, and vendor assessments, and review material technical risks and proposed exceptions, documenting mitigation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; and recommending decisions to security leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Lead security technology initiatives from requirements and proof of concept through deployment, integration, support transition, and operational acceptance, setting technical priorities with IT Operations, Platform Engineering, and application teams without direct people-management responsibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Create clear technical standards, runbooks, implementation documentation, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;knowledge-transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; materials; mentor less experienced team members and improve operational processes through engineering and automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Section&quot;&gt;To be Successful in the role, you will have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; 5-8+ years of hands-on information security engineering, security infrastructure, cloud security, or closely related experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Demonstrated success designing, deploying, integrating, and troubleshooting enterprise security technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Strong knowledge of cloud and infrastructure security, network security, operating systems, identity and access management, and enterprise authentication.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Practical experience with security monitoring, endpoint security, vulnerability management, incident response, and secure configuration practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Working knowledge of application and API security, common vulnerability classes, and secure software delivery processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Ability to script or automate technical processes and integrate tools using APIs or similar mechanisms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Familiarity with ISO 27001, SOC 2, FedRAMP, NIST SP 800-53, and risk-based security control implementation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Strong ownership, independent problem-solving, written communication, and cross-functional project delivery skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Experience delivering security controls for SaaS, cloud-native, or other complex technology products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Hands-on experience with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;DevSecOps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;, infrastructure as code, detection engineering, and security automation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; highly &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;advantageous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Experience securing generative AI or agentic AI applications and connected tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; desirable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Direct experience supporting FedRAMP authorization or continuous monitoring in an applicable environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; preferred but not essential&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; Relevant certifications such as CISSP, CCSP, GIAC, or cloud security credentials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt; highly &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;JD Bullet&quot;&gt;advantageous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:202}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are and what we stand for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nozomi Networks is the leader in OT and IoT Cybersecurity. We protect the world&#39;s critical infrastructure, industrial and government organizations from cyber threats by providing exceptional network visibility, threat detection and operational insight. We’re always innovating and we hire the best at what they do to ensure our customers always have access to fast product enhancements, exceptional engineering support and rapid deployment across continents.&amp;nbsp;If you like a challenge, and value integrity and customer success, we invite you to help Nozomi Networks build the future of OT and IoT cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity, Inclusion and Belonging are part of our core beliefs, at Nozomi Networks. Diversity of thought, background and culture broadens our knowledge of the world and helps us learn, grow, and gain new perspectives. What makes us all different is what makes us powerful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of our benefits are customized to the country you are based in, naturally we want to get the best out of our Nozomiers, so we provide the best benefits packages, such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unparalleled Flexible Time-Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Need to know information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successful candidates will be subjected to background verification checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be cautious of unsolicited messages, fake email addresses, requests for money and unclear job descriptions. Report suspicious activity to authorities. Our open job opportunities and descriptions are posted on Nozomi Networks&#39; career page. If in any doubt please apply for opportunities on our careers website &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nozominetworks.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you would like to know more about our Privacy Policy, please click &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nozominetworks.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Any questions about how we process personal information, or if you would like help exercising your privacy rights please contact us using the email provided within the Privacy Policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Staff DevOps Engineer, AI Security to join our team. This is a Remote role, reporting to the Director, DevOps - AI Security in the AI Guard department. This role owns and evolves the multi-region Kubernetes platform behind Zscaler’s AI Security products, which inspect LLM and agent traffic in real time using ML models on GPU infrastructure. As the senior platform engineer in EMEA, you will set technical direction for infrastructure, delivery, and tooling, and build the automation that lets a small team run a large, globally distributed fleet safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own multi-region infrastructure and delivery, designing and maintaining OpenTofu/Terraform modules, CI/CD pipelines, Helm charts, and GitOps workflows to ensure repeatable, low-risk deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep EKS clusters healthy and cost-efficient across microservices, API gateways, Kafka-based event pipelines, and GPU model serving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build observability and automation into the platform by setting up metrics, logging, tracing, and SLOs while writing Python and Go tooling to reduce operational toil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver secure and compliant infrastructure meeting CIS, STIG, and FedRAMP-style controls with hardened minimal images and least-privilege IAM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the EMEA platform lead to improve incident response, mentor engineers, and partner globally on architecture and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. true ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback-knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and never stop developing yourself, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of engineering experience, including 5+ years in DevOps, SRE, or platform engineering with senior/staff-level ownership of production infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on AWS experience, including EKS, VPC networking, IAM, MSK, RDS/Aurora, Route 53, and load balancing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Terraform or OpenTofu experience, including module design and state management, plus CI/CD pipeline automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux fundamentals and Python and/or Go proficiency for automation, with experience running observability stacks and owning on-call, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in MLOps automation, including managing GPU workloads on Kubernetes, configuring model serving engines (Ray, KServe, Triton, or SageMaker), and building pipelines for LLM-based applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running multi-region, multi-tenant SaaS with cell-based architecture, Kafka event pipelines, ClickHouse analytical stores, and EU data residency boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of compliance frameworks (FedRAMP, CIS, STIG), hardened container images, and service mesh architectures like Istio or Envoy with mTLS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE &lt;br&gt;#LI-MM8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we&#39;re building the most secure milkman on earth. Our Security team owns the security tooling that protects Picnic, and we&#39;re looking for a Java Engineer to make it work everywhere: connecting our systems to those tools, automating checks across the whole company, and strengthening how we manage identity and access.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll be the engineer in the Security team. Instead of writing policies, you&#39;ll write the code that wires our security systems into the rest of Picnic, and you&#39;ll help product teams do the right thing by default.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of projects from concept to delivery, aligning technical solutions with business goals with a product engineering mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform work:&lt;/strong&gt; Own Picnic’s core Security and IAM platform services, and build integrations with internal and external services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Help take our IAM initiative from MVP to production. Look at the options, build or integrate the pieces and connect them to the systems Picnic runs on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with development teams to integrate security best practices into the software development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Ambassador: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct application security workshops to raise awareness and promote secure coding practices among developers.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Java 21/25 (Spring 6 with Spring Boot 3.5, Reactor, Immutables, Maven), React, Angular, RabbitMQ, Kafka, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Git, Docker, AWS, Helm, Terraform, Kubernetes, Vault, Datadog, Python 3.x&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a Master’s Degree (in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Information Technology, Computer Engineering or a related technical field) or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 3-7 years of professional experience with Java.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine curiosity about security: experience isn’t required, but you’re excited to dive into topics like access control and to grow into the domain with us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your English skills are on point (no Dutch required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re based in or happy to relocate to the Netherlands*&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For bonus points:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Security frameworks like NIST, CIS Controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working experience in IAM integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work from our office in Amsterdam. Being present makes a genuine difference to your team and the work. There&#39;s flexibility to work from home when needed, but if remote or hybrid-first is what you&#39;re after, this probably isn&#39;t the right fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾 Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍎 You are what you eat&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏽 Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials. There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔋 Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, if you want to find our relocation benefits, see &lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/relocation&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complexe projecten, volop mogelijkheden om te groeien en werken bij één van de top Microsoft system integrators van Nederland. Als Senior Project manager ben je verantwoordelijk voor de implementatie van Microsoft technologie en geef je leiding aan het projectteam van HSO.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We bouwen steeds vaker oplossingen voor klanten die niet alleen ERP willen, maar die bewust kiezen voor het Microsoft Cloud platform. En dus bijvoorbeeld ook kiezen voor Dynamics 365 for CRM, Field Service en Power BI. Omdat HSO één van de weinige Microsoft system integrators is, kunnen we klanten deze totaaloplossing bieden. De complexe en grotere internationale projecten vragen veel expertise en ervaring, Dus we hebben volop werk en uitdaging!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ben jij gewend om grootschalige Microsoft applicatie projecten te leiden?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Senior Project manager schakel je continu tussen de belangen van de klant en HSO. De projecten zijn bovengemiddeld complex van aard en de stakeholders zijn vaak over meerdere bedrijven en de wereld verspreid. Dit is geen uitdaging maar gesneden koek voor jou.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jij beschikt over:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ten minste 5 jaar ervaring met ERP-implementaties als Project manager;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je deelt onze mind set: je bent een kritische denker, een ondernemende zelf starter en je verbindt je met het resultaat;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je business English is dik in orde, gezien onze internationale projecten;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je management vaardigheden zijn consulterend, anticiperend en voorstellend van aard en gebruikt deze eigenschappen om mensen met je mee te krijgen en effectief te laten functioneren;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ervaring met het Microsoft-platform, Dynamics AX 2012 of Dynamics 365 is een pre;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aantoonbare kennis van methodieken voor project management zowel waterval als Agile, bijvoorbeeld PRINCE II, PMI- of IPMA C/D-certificering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden we jou?   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Werken bij HSO is uitdagend, we willen je daar graag een goede beloning voor teruggeven. Naast goede primaire voordelen bieden wij: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een competitief salaris en een jaarlijkse bonus op basis van bedrijfs-, team- en individuele prestaties&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobiliteitsvergoeding waarbij je of een auto kunt leasen of het bedrag toe kunt voegen aan je salaris. Daarbovenop krijg 100% betaald van de ov-kosten;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vakantiedagen met de mogelijkheid om er 35 van te maken; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybride werken, vanuit huis, op kantoor (Rotterdam, Veenendaal) of zelfs tijdens je Workation; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EUR 65,- netto vitaliteitsbudget – we vinden het belangrijk dat we gezond blijven en een veilige werkplek hebben, zowel op kantoor als remote; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt deelnemen aan het leasefietsplan; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;En vooral een leven lang leren. Op dag één start jouw onboardingprogramma, daarnaast krijg je een persoonlijk studiebudget dat je kunt inzetten voor jouw professionele ontwikkeling en ontvang je ook een GoodHabitz account, een online trainingstool voor je persoonlijke ontwikkeling.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vrijheid, flexibiliteit en fun &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je werkt in een internationale omgeving met professionals met verschillende nationaliteiten. Een flexibele werkweek van 40, 36 of 32 uur behoort tot de mogelijkheden omdat wij van mening zijn dat jouw manier van werken bij jouw levensstijl moet passen. HSO heeft professionals in dienst die plezier hebben in hun werk en klaar staan voor elkaar. Om het plezier in ons werk nog groter te maken, organiseren we uiteraard teamuitjes en bedrijfsfeesten, maar ook wekelijkse zomerborrels op ons dakterras, allerlei sportactiviteiten en is er de mogelijkheid bij te dragen aan onze Maatschappelijk Verantwoord Ondernemen-werkzaamheden.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over HSO  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HSO is de eerste full-service Microsoft Partner in Nederland. Samen met ruim 2500 getalenteerde medewerkers in Europa, Azië en Noord-Amerika verlenen we ondersteuning op lokaal en internationaal niveau aan industriële bedrijven, retailers, financiële en zakelijke dienstverleners en overheidsinstellingen. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HSO is voortdurend op zoek naar nieuw talent. We blijven onze wereldwijde community uitbreiden en scheppen er plezier in om samen te werken met prestatiegerichte mensen met een ondernemersgeest. Professionals die voortdurend willen leren en innoveren. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solliciteren &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enthousiast? Heb je vragen vooraf? &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
